<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins steady to $4.00 lower; butts mostly $2.00 lower; skinned hams 1.00-2.00 higher; seedless bellies steady to $3.00 lower; lean trimmings steady to $2.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Trading was slow, with light demand with moderate to heavy retail offerings and light to moderate processing offerings.</p>
